.\regress\artifacts\vmedefaultkill\measure_20261009\agy_vme1009.txt:100:- **DECLINE**: At site A1 line 452, reading `vme2_masterctl` returns `0x00000000`. The guest initializes `ctl = 0`. At lines 467, 480, and 482 (sites A2, A3, A4), writes to `vme2_master3`, `vme2_master4`, and `vme2_master4mod` are silently dropped. At line 494 (site A5), writing `ctl` back to `vme2_masterctl` is silently dropped. The guest kernel continues executing past `vme2chip_init` without an exception or panic, although hardware VME master address translation windows are unmapped.
