.\regress\artifacts\vmedefaultkill\measure_20261009\agy_vme1009.txt:124:- **DECLINE**: Site H1 line 576 reads `vme2_irqstat` as `0x00000000`. In the expression `!(vme2->vme2_irqstat & VME2_IRQ_AB)`, `0x00000000 & 0x40000000` evaluates to `0`, and `!(0)` evaluates to true. `vme2abort` immediately prints `"vme2abort irq not set\n"` and returns `0` at line 578. It never reaches line 581 (site H2, `vme2->vme2_irqclr = VME2_IRQ_AB`) and never calls `nmihand(frame);`. The abort switch event is discarded as a spurious interrupt.
