30050:     "note": "#566 PASS 2 (the diff): 12 flags -- Grok 4.7: a poll-kill during `step 65536' lets `xbit rev2' print got=1 ok, so a stall leaves all 41 checks green on V2_assigntick (disclosed; FILED as ip30stallgreen); the opening comment's `latched announce' and the 568 s (shared with Astra and GLM); `the waits are wall-clock' against the blocking reap; the stall sentence missed `acc 30 rd' and the count rows; the probe note's table-4/table-5 attribution of `xbit rev2', its `ten cells, all rowed', its `this section was not updated', its missing `All FIVE ISR sites' and CLAIM UNDER TEST, and 10/33 written where a red count stood (all TAKEN); the bug file's 2026-09-18 date for #531's pass 2 (TAKEN: 2026-09-17) and its #527-shape requirement (TAKEN in part).  `a scratch clone of build/' REJECTED: legs566.sh copies build/.  It ruled D1 keep in work without the #527-shape requirement, and D2 edit with the note repaired."
